{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>文章來源：Qooah.com</p><a href=\"https://qooah.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/235364987021321837.webp\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><p><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"502\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/1b6f5299c371d8166f6b77b75a509c7bb8befe300c4d9ba359f3cd1e276d339f/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Filoveapps.com%2F5af643eda1f7365b4cdfe1c0291f2216\" width=\"960\"/></p></a><p>小米香港於今日正式開售 Xiaomi 18 Pro 系列，陣容包含 Xiaomi 18 Pro 以及定位更高的 Xiaomi 18 Pro Max 兩款機型。最大特色為機身背部搭載 M11 規格 AI 百變背屏，結合 LEICA 聯合調校的雙 2 億像素相機，同時導入硬件等級的螢幕防窺技術，搭載高通新一代 2nm 旗艦處理器，在影像、AI 交互、續航顯示各個維度完成升級。全系列當日中午 12 時起於小米之家、官方網站以及各大電訊零售商同步上架。</p><p></p><a href=\"https://qooah.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/42726489721682197.webp\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><p><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"540\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/435813cbd7a2b5178adc1554c42e9717dabc5b32708d6a00f4343b4a56354cd2/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Filoveapps.com%2F4276dbaef12e2407ce10a6ab47f2bd13\" width=\"960\"/></p></a><p>兩台手機在機身尺寸上作出明顯區分。Xiaomi 18 Pro 配備 6.4 吋主屏幕，機身寬度 72mm，偏向單手操作；Xiaomi 18 Pro Max 則搭載 6.9 吋大屏，適合影音娛樂與多任務處理。兩者主屏幕都採用 HyperRGB 2.0 像素架構，峰值亮度可達 4,000nit，支援 1 至 120Hz LTPO 自適應刷新率，並且內建硬件 Privacy Display 防窺機制，能夠限制側方視角窺看畫面，還可以針對個別 App、彈窗通知獨立開啟防窺，同時通過多項 TÜV 萊茵護眼認證。</p><p><p></p><p><p></p><p></p><p></p></p></p><a href=\"https://qooah.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/27483623982169738216.webp\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><p><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"540\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/b5da8e2d75fc98d904f72524266df2f56fdd6554ad772650864ff46e0be55921/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Filoveapps.com%2Fb0176428b0bb055d288c4e95e2fd820b\" width=\"960\"/></p></a><p>機背的副屏幕同樣使用 M11 AMOLED 面板，擁有 4,000nit 峰值亮度與靈活刷新率，採用一體玻璃設計，不僅可以當作後置相機的實時取景器，方便使用後置鏡頭完成自拍與 Vlog 錄製，亦能夠固定登機證、二維碼，或是運用 AI 生成專屬桌布與輕量小工具；雙面屏幕亦可實現面對面雙語翻譯的實用場景。</p><a href=\"https://qooah.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/23423523564325235.webp\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><p><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"540\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/a216d138371018e72f1bdc618041aceb82c036936fb94823bc2755cad4b13f24/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Filoveapps.com%2F1312317732d5683ef76ce9318688ad60\" width=\"960\"/></p></a><p>影像部分適逢小米與 LEICA 合作五週年，Xiaomi 18 Pro 系列配置雙 2 億像素光學鏡頭。主鏡搭配 Summilux f/1.67 鏡頭，長焦採用全新 Power Prism 潛望模組，提升進光表現，另外配備 5,000 萬像素超廣角鏡頭。Pro Max 版本的主攝搭載 Light Fusion 960L 感光元件，強化逆光場景的動態範圍；長焦支援 75mm 人像一直到 150mm 光學級變焦，還可實現 12cm 長焦微距拍攝。系統層面搭載多套 AI 影像風格濾鏡，內含黑白底片、復古 CCD 等多種模擬色彩，同時擁有 AI 人像補光、智慧構圖建議。影片錄製最高支援 8K 30fps 以及 4K 120fps 杜比視界格式，配合背屏取景，大幅簡化後置鏡頭自拍創作流程。</p><a href=\"https://qooah.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/436524353214235234534.webp\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><p><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"540\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/64f1b925f0c898dc68511b13a0f930caa45257e6e7d639eb6797bc7f6ea66345/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Filoveapps.com%2Ffa80e19bf58682849e0ab9a4b9c8ac0a\" width=\"960\"/></p></a><p>性能方面，兩款機型分別搭載不同等級的高通旗艦晶片。Xiaomi 18 Pro 使用 Snapdragon 8 Elite Gen 6，而 Xiaomi 18 Pro Max 升級為 Snapdragon 8 Elite Extreme Gen 6。兩顆晶片都採用台積電 2nm GAA 工藝，CPU 最高可達 5GHz，NPU 算力增強，帶來更強的端側 AI 處理能力。</p><a href=\"https://qooah.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/4326452345432653.webp\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><p><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"540\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/56ef49b72fec248697d1053afde75bb5ae2c023d4914c3b5aa3407c5ab45bfd1/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Filoveapps.com%2Ff11621bf43973156d5f4b5878eef06e7\" width=\"960\"/></p></a><p>Pro Max 加入 Offset 封裝搭配 3D IceLoop 散熱架構，優化高負載時的導熱效率。</p><a href=\"https://qooah.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/2348743628912367947123.webp\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><p><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"540\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/67623b269c618bb043d5cba69128ad3f5a64b7dd64614b70d17ebae7d7ca02cd/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Filoveapps.com%2F67be64e56bb6e2fe7dc891ae2918db28\" width=\"960\"/></p></a><p>電池採用矽碳電芯技術，Xiaomi 18 Pro Max 搭載 7,050mAh 容量，支援 100W 有線以及 50W 無線充電；Xiaomi 18 Pro 則是 6,000mAh，對應 90W 有線快充，兩者均支援無線反向充電。系統預裝 HyperOS 4，整合 Gemini 大模型，提供語言生成、會議記錄摘要等 AI 工具，強化跨裝置互聯能力。</p><p>售價方面：</p><p>Xiaomi 18 Pro<br/>12+256GB 定價 HK$8,999<br/>12+512GB 定價 HK$9,999</p><p>Xiaomi 18 Pro Max<br/>12+256GB 定價 HK$9,999<br/>12+512GB 定價 HK$10,999<br/>16GB+1TB 版本會延後至 12 月中下旬上市</p><a href=\"https://qooah.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/574343254214235213.webp\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><p><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"520\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/2cd93a924c32778e1d007fe13a09ed58598e63e54298372fa9ba36050903c51d/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Filoveapps.com%2Fc8f9fa19e51b412ff1f44bdb7be467e1\" width=\"960\"/></p></a><a href=\"https://qooah.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/623523462345432.webp\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><p><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"532\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/2498e2bf4c1c375de3b32f1bb6c2708e4db368c5da20089df5c4b70af418d728/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Filoveapps.com%2F6cba9dedea59c0f7ccae7f66bbc25bd8\" width=\"960\"/></p></a></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-18T13:44:05.259547+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1554,"images":9,"source":"Yahoo 科技","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-18T10:23:58+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-18T21:38:02.681234+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-18T13:37:35.356965+00:00","content_hash":"509fb2caac29542b8df0ae55239bbd1724abce75e8744d32f700cdeed232deea","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}